Hello World!

## GitHub Copilot Package

This repository now includes the GitHub Copilot CLI package.

### Installation

The project has been set up as a Node.js project with the following package installed:
- `@github/copilot` v0.0.354 - GitHub Copilot CLI that brings the power of Copilot coding agent directly to your terminal.

### Usage

To use the installed package:
```bash
npm install
```

This will install all dependencies including the GitHub Copilot package.
